(D/'DERIVATION.md').write_text("""# Certified budget reallocation
Let H=(H_1,...,H_n), residual work b, feasible root/local computation c=(i,z), deterministic work k(c)>0. For a fixed decision rule d_i, terminal utility U(H)=sum_i w_i E[u_i(d_i(H_i))|H], and risk penalty R(H)=sum_i w_i r_i(H_i), where r_i is the regret upper bound of the action actually chosen, or R_i*=min_a upper regret if explicitly choosing minimax-risk action. Do not substitute R_i* for bound on arbitrary NN/visit choice. For coherent beliefs and risk trade-off w_g,w_r>=0, V(H,b)=max{w_g U(H)-w_r R(H), max_{c:k<=b} E[V(H',b-k)|H,c]}. Cost-priced variant subtracts lambda C(c) (utility/us); hard stochastic time requires resource transition and possible overrun. Original prior-weighted Gibbs Q proportional Pi exp(beta action score), not implemented this turn; score risk is not expected gain.
Exact STOP contraction lemma. Suppose a root i has sound witness a*, retained irrevocably, terminal objective additive across roots, further observations of i cannot change other root information or resource feasibility except cost, and computation is optional. V_i optimal terminal utility already achieved pathwise; extra steps on i cannot increase utility or reduce certificate regret below0. Given any schedule spending work on i after certification, replace those computations with idle, retaining its witness and all other root actions. Under independent transition kernels/coupled random tapes of remaining roots this preserves other terminal output distribution and consumes no more resource. With nonnegative costs no worse objective. Thus an optimal policy exists that never computes on a certified root; theorem does not imply any heuristic allocation of saved work improves actual decisions. Cross-root knowledge transfer, mandatory output beyond WDL, shared hardware nonlinearities or state-dependent feasibility can invalidate the simple contraction argument. An actual MCTS recommendation may worsen after extra work, so RR is not pathwise improvement. Counterexample one unresolved root initially right, extra noisy search changes recommendation wrong. With coherent posterior reoptimization and ability to ignore extra observations, nonnegative expected information value holds; not for arbitrary approximate MCTS.
Work identity. Each root has mandatory p=8 visits and equal optional entitlement q=15 blocks of8. Pool budget K=nq. Let b_i actual optional blocks, S=sum_i(q-b_i)_+, E=sum_i(b_i-q)_+. Then S-E=K-sum_i b_i=unused>=0. Certified shortfall C=sum_{retired by cert}(q-b_i)_+<=S. If all shortfalls are certified, E=C-unused, so extra blocks genuinely reuse certified work, not just changes in order. Report C,S,E,unused independently; in shared WORK cap512 never binds for n=4, K=60, hence no noncert shortfall except certified-all termination (fixed quotas control). For TIME use measured whole budget and per-root search entitlement in fixed arms, not convert wall to visits. Mandatory setup/prefix, scheduler, actual continuation, final output/snapshot and destruction all charged; time limit only checked between blocks, reserve estimated on TRAIN, no hard guarantee. No padding.
Risk scheduler: for full legal actions intervals [L_a,U_a], d_i=min_a max(0,max_{j!=a} U_j-L_a) in integer {0,1,2}; candidate count h_i=#{a: U_a>=max L, L_a<U_a}. Unresolved eligible roots ranked by (d_i,h_i,-blocks_i,-cyclic order index), with d=0 certificate excludes root. RR picks next eligible cyclic. d is upper bound on best robust action regret times2, not value of next computation; tie with candidate count can favor difficult roots. Counterexample high risk root with no possible informative action and low risk root with informative action: max-risk not max VOC. Evaluate whether priority actually changes allocations and decision quality, do not promote without paired evidence. Local RR_SAFE retains all non-dominated actions, contrasted with RR unresolved priority; exact solved skip and root decision identical. No new full FOCUS/EXPAND/MERGE competition.
Conditional statistical backup: graph exact facts immutable; only blend when selected trajectory not terminal/proved and exact child interval not collapsed at check. Reuse prior eta(n)=min(.25,n/(n+4)); no retuning. B1 coherent writes alone, B2 own past raw, B3 other incoming context raw. Graph lock snapshot for exact state check; statistical ledger retains prior TT key identity (not independent evidence and not a proof). Maintain exactly one observation/edge and one visit; compare against RR and RR_WRITER. Separate offline pair MSE from actual policy utility.
""".replace("  \n","\n"))
